msgstr "Jetzt synchronisieren"

#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-settings.php:293
msgid ""
"The context ID changed, so the next synchronisation imports your whole "
"catalogue again. This makes sure every product and category comes from the "
"new context."
msgstr ""
"Die Kontext-ID wurde geändert, daher importiert die nächste Synchronisierung "
"Ihren gesamten Katalog erneut. So stammen alle Produkte und Kategorien aus "
"dem neuen Kontext."

#: includes/class-skwirrel-wc-sync-admin-settings.php:425
msgid ""
"The context ID must be a whole number greater than 0. Leave it empty to use "
"the Skwirrel default context."
msgstr ""
